From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:55:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: pending: c37ab55c4a (15.6.75.76, crbug 579314138)

V8 15.6.75.76 change from the 8078 branch: bound the string length in
String::ToStdString and ToCString with SBXCHECK_LE against
String::kMaxLength, so a string corrupted inside the sandbox cannot
produce a UTF-8 length that ICU truncates to -1. Byte-identical to
upstream .76 on 15.6.75.66. Goes after the 3.2.0 cache epoch patch
(3.2-v8/0002); no epoch change needed. V8 gitlink unchanged.
